deo class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317960/extras/be22b6a41e0c82e317b20cb04f145b5c.poster.avif?t=1754393677\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317960/extras/be22b6a41e0c82e317b20cb04f145b5c.webm?t=1754393677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317960/extras/be22b6a41e0c82e317b20cb04f145b5c.mp4?t=1754393677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Explore</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the mysterious world of microbiology and explore nine large, handcrafted, visual distinct areas. To enhance replayablity you will find the levels changing, with different paths and challenges each time you enter while still having a handcrafted, purposeful level design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317960/extras/3167b07c2ef9ee7e430ab3c2a3993fb4.poster.avif?t=1754393677\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317960/extras/3167b07c2ef9ee7e430ab3c2a3993fb4.webm?t=1754393677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317960/extras/3167b07c2ef9ee7e430ab3c2a3993fb4.mp4?t=1754393677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Build Your Organism</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start as a single-celled organism. Divide your cells to grow and enhance your organism into a creature that is fit to survive in a hostile environment. Each cell has its own set of mutations, so you not only have the choice of which upgrades to pick, but also where to place them to have the best synnergies between them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cell division multiplies all mutations of that cell, but has an increasing cost. Decide when to start copying your upgrades and when it's best to build up cells by picking new upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317960/extras/2fa4a031770079732512e2bf81131006.avif?t=1754393677\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Enhance Your Genes</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match random mutations of 11 genes to build a unique playstyle for each organism. Find synnergies between genes and between mutations within genes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3317960/extras/6eb67e76f37d3db691e70b6e2aec29d2.avif?t=1754393677\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "short_description": "Action Roguelike where you build your organism by dividing and placing cells. Pick from random mutations and specialize your cells in any of 11 genes. Test your organism in a fast paced melee- and ranged combat with timing-based parry system against enemies and bosses.",
